        "original_id": "3f4b169a-0959-5faa-a971-defb838624c2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: The Arts Fuse, Visionaire\n- People: Gerald Peary\n- Places: Greater Boston, Connecticut, Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Rhode Island, Vermont, New York, New England\n- Topics: arts media, cultural events, transmedia publishing\n\nFacts:\n- The Arts Fuse is an online arts magazine that covers cultural events in Greater Boston and across Connecticut, Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Rhode Island, Vermont, and New York.\n- The Arts Fuse provides a next-generation platform for arts and culture consumers across New England and beyond.\n- Visionaire is a transmedia company that publishes a magazine also named Visionaire.\n- Visionaire concepts, curates, and produces art multiples, events, public art installations, film, branded content, apparel, and publications.\n- Gerald Peary is a critic-at-large for The Arts Fuse, a Boston-based online arts magazine.",
